# Alembic migrations

PostgreSQL schema migrations for DashNoteSystem. Revisions live in `alembic/versions/`. `env.py` loads ORM models from `src/` so autogenerate sees the full metadata.

## Commands

**Docker (recommended)**

```powershell
docker compose run --rm migrate              # upgrade to head
docker compose down -v                       # reset DB volumes, then migrate again
```

**Local** (set `DATABASE_URL` in `.env`; async URL is converted to sync in `env.py`)

```powershell
alembic upgrade head
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
alembic downgrade -1
```

